WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.070
STEVEN
I can't tell the difference...

00:00:02.121 --> 00:00:03.726
GHOSTLY VOICE
Steven...

00:00:04.633 --> 00:00:08.352
STEVEN
...between my waking life and dreams.

00:00:08.403 --> 00:00:09.708
♫ Day and night ♫

00:00:09.758 --> 00:00:12.411
ARTHUR HARROW
It must be very difficult. The voices...

00:00:12.461 --> 00:00:13.755
♫ In my mind, mind ♫

00:00:13.805 --> 00:00:14.466
ARTHUR HARROW
...in your head.

00:00:14.516 --> 00:00:15.492
GHOSTLY VOICE
Steven.

00:00:15.543 --> 00:00:16.516
STEVEN
Shut! Up!

00:00:16.566 --> 00:00:17.341
♫ Day and night ♫

00:00:17.391 --> 00:00:18.672
ARTHUR HARROW
There's chaos in you.

00:00:20.890 --> 00:00:21.750
Embrace it.

00:00:25.883 --> 00:00:27.194
♫ Day and night ♫

00:00:27.734 --> 00:00:29.497
♫ At, at, at night ♫

